      "text": "WHEREAS, the benefit enhancements provided for in the Elections will be funded by member contributions at a rate over and above the existing rate for member contributions provided for by applicable law (\"Additional Member Contributions\"), such that the benefit enhancements provided for in the Elections will require no additional contribution by the City to the New York City Employees Retirement System; and",
